    "title": "Hancock community names Memorial Medical Clinics top choice for care - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Abreanna Blose ,\n19 hours ago\nMemorial Medical Clinics has been named the best medical clinic in Hancock County by the 2025 Dammy Awards, according to a community announcement.\nThe annual awards, hosted by Radio Keokuk, recognize local organizations that positively impact Hancock County residents. The winners are selected through community nominations and voting.\n“We’re truly honored to receive this award,” Tasha Koehler, executive director of clinic operations, said in the announcement. “Every member of our team is committed to providing exceptional care. This recognition reflects their daily dedication and the trust our patients place in us.”\nFor more information about Memorial Medical Clinics, visit mhtlc.org .\nThis story was created by reporter Abreanna Blose, ablose@usatodayco.com , with the assistance of Artificial Intelligence (AI). Journalists were involved in every step of the information gathering, review, editing and publishing process. Learn more at cm.usatoday.com/ethical-conduct .\nThis article originally appeared on The McDonough County Voice: Hancock community names Memorial Medical Clinics top choice for care\n2",
